                 +-----------------------+
                 | real-part   imag-part |
-----------------|                       |------------------
                 | magnitude   angle     |
                 +-----------+-----------+
           Rectangular       |          Polar
          representation     |     representation
-----------------------------+------------------------------
       List structure and primitive machine arithmetic
@end example
@end quotation
@end ifinfo
